      "body": "Type in the **New task** field and press Enter. Done: the task goes to the Inbox (or to the open page).\n\n## Quick syntax\n\nThe text itself fills in the details:\n\n- `tomorrow`, `friday`, `10/15` — due date\n- `3pm`, `at 9:30`, `14:05` — time (no date means today); it reminds you at that time, and you can change the reminder in the panel\n- `!`, `!!`, `!!!` — priority\n- `#groceries` — label\n- `/daily`, `/weekly`, `/mon,wed` — repeat\n- `3x12` — 3 sets of 12; `x8` — do it 8 times\n- `@ana` — assignee (in a project)\n\nExample: `Pay the power bill friday !! #home` becomes \"Pay the power bill\", due Friday, medium priority, label home.\n\n## Many at once\n\nPaste a list (one per line) or tap **Many**. Indented lines become subtasks. You see a preview before creating.\n\n## Checking off\n\nTap the box. Mistake? The notice has **Undo**."
